      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SYNTHESISE (1) brings the strongest overall form and looks well placed second-up. She was beaten a length and a half as favourite at this track first-up, but that followed a fifth in the G3 SA Fillies Classic and she has already won at this venue. May prove too good for these. NO MANS LAND (4) ran a strong BM68 second two back and had to do work from a slow start in BM64 grade last time when eighth. The mile remains a small query, but this is a more suitable assignment and best form puts him right in this. WIN TO RETIRE (9) is going along well with two placings from three starts this time in. On the quick back-up and looks threatening. BELLE FROM HELL (8) returns from a freshening with BM58 form around her and a genuine 1600m record, making her a credible value chance if she runs up to her Murray Bridge second.",
